This project builds on the graph model, sample data and queries of Neo4j's
fraud demo, https://github.com/neo4j-product-examples/demo-fraud, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The demo's files are not included in
this repository: scripts/fetch-demo.sh downloads them at a pinned commit and
checks them against scripts/neo4j-demo.sha256. Queries adapted from the demo's
dashboard (src/neodash/fraud-dashboard.json) are marked where they appear.
